# 4 子项属性

## 4.1 flex-basis

设置弹性盒伸缩基准值，注意你设置了 flex-basis 的话，width 就失效了

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
